{
  "slug": "mcp",
  "name": "Mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The Microsoft Learn MCP Server enables clients like GitHub Copilot and other AI agents to bring trusted and up-to-date information directly from Microsoft's official documentation. It is a remote MCP server that uses streamable http. It allows to search through documentation, fetch a complete article, and search through code samples.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `microsoft-code-reference` (Find working code samples, verify API signatures, and fix Microsoft SDK errors using official docs), `microsoft-docs` (Understand Microsoft technologies by querying official documentation), `microsoft-skill-creator` (Create agent skills for Microsoft technologies using official documentation)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `microsoft-learn`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mcp@claude-community` from `MicrosoftDocs/mcp`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
